  ['Window borders and rounded corners', 'Hyprland + shared token', 'Generated decoration default in user looknfeel.lua. Per-window rules and fullscreen behavior retain precedence.', 'window-rules.lua / lucent-setup.py'],
  ['Monitors, input, keymaps and scaling', 'Hyprland / system configuration', 'Lucent receives output and seat events; integer surface scale is supported. Per-output desktop state is unfinished.', '~/.config/hypr/'],
  ['Desktop widgets and drag grid', 'Lucent', 'Layer surfaces below normal windows. Client geometry, token grid, persisted positions and visibility.', 'widgets.rs / shell_layout.rs'],
  ['Light and dark shell palette', 'Lucent', 'Semantic design tokens. This switch changes Lucent components, not installed application themes.', 'DesktopSettings.light / lucent-design'],
  ['Terminal, browser and GTK themes', 'Omarchy / each application', 'Omarchy theme commands and application configuration remain authoritative.', 'Omarchy Style → Theme'],
  ['Wallpaper selector', 'Lucent', 'Native animated carousel selects a path and calls the wallpaper port.', 'WallpaperPort → OmarchyWallpaper'],
  ['Desktop wallpaper display', 'Stock Omarchy shell', 'Omarchy applies/displays the selected background. Lucent does not replace this background service.', 'omarchy-theme-bg-set'],
  ['Lock and login wallpaper', 'Lucent clients + sync adapter', 'Native clients render a wallpaper image; helper synchronizes a readable copy for the login user.', 'lucent-wallpaper.py / lucent-session'],
  ['Notifications and history', 'Lucent', 'Owns org.freedesktop.Notifications after handoff; native toasts/history, actions, expiry and DND. History is in memory.', 'NotificationPort → FreedesktopNotifications'],
  ['Keybinding picker', 'Lucent UI + Omarchy behavior', 'Omarchy discovers bindings; a native picker selects the original value; Omarchy dispatches it.', 'omarchy-menu-keybindings / lucent-menu.py'],
  ['Root and nested menus', 'Lucent UI + Omarchy definitions', 'JSONC model and extensions feed the native picker. Adapter evaluates availability and dispatches trusted actions.', 'menu_model.py / lucent-menu-routes.py'],
  ['Specialized stock panels', 'Stock Omarchy shell', 'Unmapped actions that directly call omarchy-shell can still open stock UI. They are not native Lucent components.', 'Installed Omarchy menu actions'],
  ['Audio volume / mute', 'Lucent controls + WirePlumber', 'Adapter calls wpctl; audio routing and device services remain system-owned.', 'AudioPort → WirePlumber'],
  ['Media playback', 'Lucent controls + playerctl', 'Player metadata/control through playerctl; periodic snapshots.', 'MediaPort → Playerctl'],
  ['Network status and Wi-Fi setup', 'Lucent status + system/Omarchy setup', 'Status sampled through nmcli. No native Lucent Wi-Fi configuration port/control center yet.', 'SystemPort → LinuxSystem'],
  ['Bluetooth, brightness and power profiles', 'System / Omarchy tools', 'Actions use existing providers. No complete native Lucent adapters and controls for these capabilities.', 'Installed commands and menus'],
